# text_old = Cui Fundanius, Vide, inquit, ne, Agri, istuc sit ab hoc, cum in legibus etiam scribatur "pecus quoddam".
# text = cui Fundanius: vide – inquit – ne, Agri, istuc sit ab hoc, cum in legibus etiam scribatur “pecus quoddam”.
# text_en = To whom Fundanius: “Take care,” said he, “Agrius, that this be not beside the point, since in the leges a certain kind of livestock is also specified.”
# text_fr = À qui Fundanius : « Prends garde, dit-il, Agrius, que cela ne soit pas hors de propos, puisque dans les contrats on inscrit aussi « un certain bétail ». »
# text_fi = Mihin Fundanius: "Katso", sanoi hän, "Agrius, ettei tämä ole asiasta vieras, koska laeissa mainitaan myös 'tietty karja'."
