# text_old = contra ut Minervae caprini generis nihil immolarent propter oleam, quod eam quam laeserit fieri dicunt sterilem; eius enim salivam esse fructuis venenum;
# text = contra ut Minervae caprini generis nihil immolarent propter oleam, quod eam quam laeserit fieri dicunt sterilem; eius enim salivam esse fructuis venenum;
# text_en = On the contrary, that nothing of the goat kind should be sacrificed to Minerva, on account of the olive, since they say that the one which it has damaged becomes barren; for its saliva is poison to the fruits;
# text_fr = Mais qu'on n'immolât rien de l'espèce caprine à Minerve, à cause de l'olivier, puisqu'ils disent que celui qu'elle a blessé devient stérile ; car sa salive est un poison pour les fruits ;
